    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39876" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικρεμάννῡμι</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικρᾱτ-ύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hang over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτην τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					206
				</span></i>
			 codd.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίνδυνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					2.31.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόβον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					16.50
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικρέμαμαι</span>, aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεκρεμάσθην</span>, <i>overhang</i>,
