				<u>h.Ap.</u>
				284
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκία ἐπικρεμαμένη τῇ</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγορᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Publ.</u>
					10
