				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.483
				</span></i>
			; 
				Ep.
			3pl.
			impf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεκρεμόωντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					20.173
				</span></i>
